# The wiki repo is rooted at $HOME/work (Claude's cwd), which also holds harness
# state (.claude.json, .mcp.json, .gitconfig), node_modules, and the read-only
# source clones. Whitelist wiki content only: ignore everything at the root, then
# re-include the files and directories we maintain.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/wiki.config.json
!/index.md
!/log.md
!/pages/
!/scripts/
